From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 17:17:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 036/117] wifi: brcmfmac: load calibration data from NVMEM

Read an optional calibration cell during OF setup and pass its contents
through the existing firmware calibration path. Keep compatibility with
a brcm,cal-blob property while preferring the described NVMEM cell when
no property is present.

Track ownership of NVMEM-allocated calibration buffers and release them
with the module parameters. Propagate probe deferral and all other NVMEM
errors so firmware data cannot be consumed before its provider is ready.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: 2cb3dc88ae836e260b66078b5ea2d5b09a6e183c
